  "description": "fastino/gliner2-base-v1 (revision f9634218, GLiNER2 2.0.0) English entity extraction with labels and a threshold on ONNX Runtime: GLiNER2's Python text semantics (normalization, word splitter, lower-casing) and schema prefix through the owned tokenizer (Starlings.Tokenizers: no Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers, no native tokenizer), one ONNX graph, GLiNER2's span decoding, offsets into the original text. Ships the asset lock, not the weights; acquire them explicitly. Profiles gliner2-base-v1/onnx-fp32-cpu and onnx-fp32-cuda. The application adds the ONNX Runtime native package. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
